[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 420.79, "timestamp": "00:07:00", "text": "但我很想和他们一起玩，可是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 423.35, "timestamp": "00:07:03", "text": "不能和他们一起玩。真麻烦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 427.51, "timestamp": "00:07:07", "text": "情况。我不知道我有什么想法"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 427.58, "timestamp": "00:07:07", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ah yes, \"online friends\""}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 430.39, "timestamp": "00:07:10", "text": "尤其是对于了解推特的人来说。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 431.769, "timestamp": "00:07:11", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "u have plenty"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 432.71, "timestamp": "00:07:12", "text": "这是每个人都能看到的主要地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 435.11, "timestamp": "00:07:15", "text": "你和一切都很好，就在我直播的时候"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 439.554, "timestamp": "00:07:19", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Im sleeping early tonight~ enjoy vodnix for tonight~"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 439.83, "timestamp": "00:07:19", "text": "在 Twitch 或 YouTube 上，呃，它会……"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 440.034, "timestamp": "00:07:20", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "arusu, etc"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 443.029, "timestamp": "00:07:23", "text": "我想，你们管它叫什么呢？呃，它会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 444.71, "timestamp": "00:07:24", "text": "改用户名可以吗？就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 448.87, "timestamp": "00:07:28", "text": "我们在 Twitch 上做了。那是一条小溪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 451.189, "timestamp": "00:07:31", "text": "我们在 Twitch 上用 Touch 完成了这个操作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 454.51, "timestamp": "00:07:34", "text": "门户网站。我已经很久没和有田说话了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 457.83, "timestamp": "00:07:37", "text": "很久。兄弟，我想他了。我想念"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 460.01, "timestamp": "00:07:40", "text": "他们。我想念他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 465.909, "timestamp": "00:07:45", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 466.994, "timestamp": "00:07:46", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "zamn"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 470.11, "timestamp": "00:07:50", "text": "你好，凯。欢迎。欢迎。所以今天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 474.469, "timestamp": "00:07:54", "text": "对，我们会……呃，等等，呃，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 477.35, "timestamp": "00:07:57", "text": "今天。哦天哪，我刚才迷失了自己"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 478.99, "timestamp": "00:07:58", "text": "阅读聊天记录。是的"}]